# 7. SCHOOL DATA AND DELETE POLICIES

Implement conservative record deletion.

- Students: deactivate/reactivate instead of hard deletion.
- Teachers: deactivate; prevent hard deletion while assignments exist.
- Classes: prevent deletion while sections exist.
- Sections: prevent deletion while students exist.
- Subjects: prevent deletion while assignments exist.
- Teacher assignments: deletable with confirmation.
- Calendar events: deletable with confirmation.
- Current academic year: cannot be deleted.
- School profile: edit only.

Show understandable error messages when an operation is blocked.

These rules must be enforced in the domain/repository layer, not only hidden in the UI.

