# 13. VALIDATION AND BUSINESS RULES

Every form must have suitable validation.

Examples:

- Required fields cannot be empty.
- Invalid dates must be rejected.
- Due date should not be before assignment date.
- Obtained marks cannot exceed maximum marks.
- Duplicate roll numbers within the same section are not allowed.
- Duplicate admission numbers are not allowed.
- A teacher cannot be assigned to a nonexistent section or subject.
- Approved leave should reflect in attendance.
- Parent records must only show linked children.
- Deactivated students should not appear in new active class workflows.
- A missing attendance record must not be automatically interpreted as absent.
- A holiday must not be treated as an ordinary school day.

Show friendly, actionable validation messages.

